  <ManaDrain.endMessage>魔力回复到了正常状态。</ManaDrain.endMessage>
  <!--原中文: '行星的异变导致了魔法能量的逐渐衰落。所有与魔法力量协调的生物会缓慢地失去力量。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The planet's celestial alignment is shifting, causing an ebb in mana.\n\nAll creatures attuned with magical powers will slowly lose mana.\n\nCreatures may become physically ill if they have no mana remaining.',更新于2026-02-14-->
