  <!--原中文: '不怀好意的元素体们在你的世界打开了一道缺口并准备派遣袭击队伍通过这道缝隙。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Hostile elementals have created a breach into your world and are preparing to send assault teams through the rift!\n\nRifts cause mayhem in the atmosphere as energy leaks through the rift into your world. The following effects occur for each rift element:\n\nFire Rift: meteor showers and heat waves.\nEarth Rift: toxic fumes and causes animals to go berserk\nIce Rift: hailstorms and rapid decline in temperature\nAir Rift: lightning storms\n\nDestroy the rift to end this nightmare!',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Hostile elementals have created a breach into your world and are preparing to send assault teams through the rift!\n\nRifts cause mayhem in the atmosphere as energy leaks through the rift into your world. The following effects occur for each rift element:\n\nFire Rift: meteor showers and heat waves.\nEarth Rift: toxic fumes and causes animals to go berserk\nIce Rift: hailstorms and rapid decline in temperature\nAir Rift: lightning storms\n\nDestroy the rift to end this nightmare!-->
