  <!--原中文: '游荡的巫妖', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Wandering lich',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Wandering lich-->
  <WanderingLich.label>游荡的巫妖</WanderingLich.label>
  <!--原中文: '一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.-->
  <WanderingLich.description>一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。</WanderingLich.description>
  <!--原中文: '巫妖的进攻结束了。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The lich's assault is coming to an end.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The lich's assault is coming to an end.-->
  <WanderingLich.endMessage>巫妖的进攻结束了。</WanderingLich.endMessage>
  <!--原中文: '一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An ancient lich has wandered into the area and is preparing to assault your colony.\n\nLichs are powerful creatures by themselves, but their true strength resides in their ability to create animated undead from the corpses of the deceased.\n\nThis lich is an ancient being that despises all life, and your merry band of living -things- has so far resisted being snuffed out. It will actively seek to end your story of survival by creating a horde of undead to overwhelm your defenses.\n\nThe lich will periodically create new skeleton warriors to attack the colony; allowing the lich to complete a ritual near an exposed corpse will increase the chance skeleton giants are created. Ultimately, the lich will assault the colony itself, if waves of undead are unable to complete the task first.-->
  <WanderingLich.letterText>一位古老的巫妖已经游荡到这个地区并且准备攻击你的殖民地。巫妖本身是强大的生物，但是他们真正的力量在于他们能够从尸体中创造出能活动的不死生物。这个巫妖是一个蔑视所有生命的古老亡灵，而你的快乐的殖民地，至今还拒绝被杀死。它将通过创建一大群不死族来打破你的防御，它十分乐意击败你的殖民地。巫妖将定期创建新的骷髅战士来攻击殖民地；巫妖会在露天的尸体附近完成一个仪式将会召唤一种十分强大的骷髅。最终，巫妖将攻击殖民地本身，如果不死族的浪潮无法完成任务。巫妖会结束进攻。</WanderingLich.letterText>
