  <DemonAssault.label>狂暴的恶魔</DemonAssault.label>
  <!--原中文: '一切都会终结!-一个狂暴的恶魔正在攻击你的殖民地！\n\n这个地狱生物有各种各样的攻击方式，而且他会使用充满挑战性的战术。\n火焰和灰烬将从天而降。\n但是，恶魔无法在这个殖民地中停留很长时间，将会被迫在大约3小时内返回他们的世界。击败他或熬过这场噩梦。\n没有多少时间准备了。\n\n祝你好运！', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The end is nigh - rampaging demons are attacking your colony!\nLike a herald to impending doom, fire and ash have begun falling from the skies.\n\nThese infernal beings have an assortment of attacks and challenging tactics.\nHowever, demons are unable to remain in this realm for extended periods and will be force to return to their hellish plane in about 3 hours. Defeat or outlast this nightmare.\nThere is very little time to prepare.\n\nGood luck!',更新于2026-02-14-->
